title: "Collaboration Station Research 2.0"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-19
authors:
  - family-names: Crespo
    given-names: Randy
    affiliation: Dandelion Engineering
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dandelion-Engineering/Collaboration-Station-Research-2.0"
url: "https://github.com/Dandelion-Engineering/Collaboration-Station-Research-2.0"
abstract: >-
  Collaboration Station Research 2.0 is a filesystem-native template for
  long-running exploratory research by a human director and capable AI agents.
  It adds a compact research contract, visible consequential changes, evidence
  provenance, honest outcome boundaries, and proportionate reproducibility to
  the Collaboration Station 2.0 scaffold while avoiding mandatory AI approval
  cycles and fixed writer-reviewer roles.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - exploratory research
  - research methodology
  - reproducibility
  - multi-agent collaboration
